==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Only One Rarity}}

==Battleground==
*1 [[Mistress Celeboodle]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Mega Baa Baa]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'noir]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Capy]] spawns after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Since the enemies spawn on a timer, kill the Mistress Celeboodle to get money, then rush the base using rushers like [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. You can bring some Attack UP [[Cat Combo]]s to speed up the stage.

